<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-13T09:47:58.204Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 09:47:58 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran-backed suspects are accused of plotting attacks on a U.K. air base that hosts U.S. jets, while an Iran-backed trio is linked to a drone strike on the Khor Mor gas field in Iraqi Kurdistan that halted production and cut power. Iraqi security officials tied the Khor Mor attack to internal disputes, announced expanded air-defence deployments, and reported the arrest of a suspect for killing his brother in Shamamak. Iraq is sending a delegation to Lebanon after former MP Ahmed al-Alwani was found dead in Beirut, and the prime minister's aide said there is no deadline for disarming militias this year. 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTE5odkd1bGZOWGdpeXpQNlNHcWhfR3NTem9XcURWQnRIbHFBQ3paSzd1U0dhWWFxVG92UkxGX0ZpY0J5Z1dYSW13UUJRVkRXZGROUEhnWTFQT2Qwajd5c3dUWE95VW9VbWR4dVlkSVpscFVheDRtVkRNZS1tSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5OeVBweGtkNVFYa0x6dWd3cHZKRmtpQXp1bG44eHp3dEFMTk5wVWx5eWlVTlpZSF9GcFdCZTFKMjBHMEM1eUx0dU80bXRVSTNkcU5xc0c0emNTUkpVRkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxQUUlzcjJTNUNhUWlDcVhmY0tXbVV4ZVlOd3ZMeHg4dlZqSC1vNUpUQVl1RkNDNVIxTS1OWmozbGl2LTU4SUxIQndULUFVVS1LNXRCZmxTbWdEdzdjdlZjVFByX0RjbWpKaHhLQlc4Q3V0bEVUVVBCTTZybGx3MjQ2WlJoc0ZNNzBhUmpib055Zl95NElqR1lJVkJKOWthazRTVmJkanhXclZ5NzdjQlZwM1hYRDZ1aHBqcGpN?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kurdistan24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNNzdxTUlidWJDd01RMGdNbG9iVXl3LTJBaWM2RmdSaTZ6ZnkxUUtQVE5XZV9jQW9GWWVEcDZvVXlFUkxSbjZGUXlmRTczOE9pbERqOC1TeThBSkZBNTgtVVljOFIzbVFCX05qX3l3OTdDR0